## About this journal

This site is my ongoing reflection journal. I write dated entries about my schoolwork,
projects, challenges, and milestones, and track my progress toward my long-term goals.

It is a self-directed project: a static website built with Jekyll and hosted on GitHub Pages.
There are no comments, logins, or visitor interaction. Every entry here is written and
maintained by me.

## How to read this site

- **Journal entries** appear below, newest first. Each entry has a date and a short reflection.
- **[Goals](goals.md)** lists my long-term goals broken into smaller benchmarks, with status updates.

## Why I built this

Keeping a dated log helps me notice my own growth over time. It also doubles as a public
record of how I approach learning, problem-solving, and project work.
